Milvus milvus\"), culic mare (\"Numenius arquata\"), pi\u021bigoi de stuf (\"Panurus biarmicus\"), viespar (\"Pernis apivorus\"), ploier auriu (\"Pluvialis apricaria\"), corcodel-cu-g\u00e2t-ro\u0219u (\"Podiceps grisegena\"), corcodel-cu-g\u00e2t-negru (\"Podiceps nigricollis\"), creste\u021b cenu\u0219iu (\"Porzana parva\"), cristei de balt\u0103 (\"Rallus aquaticus\"), corcodel mic (\"Tachybaptus ruficollis\"), coco\u0219ul de mesteac\u0103n (\"Tetrao tetrix tetrix\"), fluierar de mla\u0219tin\u0103 (\"Tringa glareola\")."}
